    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ahasi sugoocheanda Yuda",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 16:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gweaydeaba damanispwa bea sugoocheanduumeeda Beka orjeeda Remaliya. Hean ghoang'eat sugoocheanduumeeda Yuda Ahasi was orjeeda Yotam. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.16.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.16.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 16:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abeeda ghoang'eat sugoocheanduumeeda nea gaba gweanyeew diktam. Ak ghwaak gweanyeew damwalah aba Yerusalemu, ak ea miigwasin gea miyaasiin aba madeeda NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEATAANYI, gawuurji gidaghayi sin Dawdi was ghwaan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.16.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.16.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 16:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak ghwaat naweeda sugoodiga Israeli. Ak ghaghwarda orjeedaanyi ghoah haleanjeeda sisabwa geadi bea ghadooweeda sighwarda. Ak gwasin ng'asheanda mwadoabiiwa bea eemoojiga ghayi ang'aamwa NG'UTAMIIDA madeeda fuga Israeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.16.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.16.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 16:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean ghoadayda haleanjeeda sisabwa geadi bea ghadooweeda sighwarda ea gea siing'andiita heetiyeada. Nea ghwayiin eara iheenga heayeeniga ea gumsheaka geediga Shabeadi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.16.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.16.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 16:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iidu gwascheeng'u Resini was sugoocheanda Shaamu sea Beka, orjeeda Remaliya was sugoocheanda Israeli. Eeng'uchi sea Yerusalemu, hean geeneaweesa Ahasi ak ea meajoora. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.16.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.16.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 16:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba damandida Resini was sugoocheanda Shaamu goodeelsa fuga Shaamu mujiineeda Elati. Ak ghahoan fuga Yahudi gwariteawa Elati, hean ghapka fuga Shaamu goobiida Elati ea ghoah ghamneawa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.16.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.16.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 16:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean goojeakta Ahasi buuneeda heeda Digilat-Bileseri was sugoocheanda Ashuru, nea gwayeesha, “Aniini ghaawaschi siida gadiyeeda. Biisa dawas orjeedang'u siyeeng'ni weadaan aba geatinda sugoocheanda Shaamu, ea geatinda sugoocheanda Israeli aba gideaba ghapka ng'ucheeda.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.16.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.16.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 16:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata gageanu Ahasi lapiya ea dahaabu siguura dahaabu geana jeeda gheeda NG'UTAMIIDA ea gea heeda siitiiwiisa haleanjeeda jeeda Ng'utamiida. Ak gweasa sugoocheanda Ashuru ghoah haleanjeeda guskuseega. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.16.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.16.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 16:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gooleeysiit sugoocheanda Ashuru Ahasi ng'ata gwascheeng'sa sugoocheanda Ashuru Dameski ak ghwajoar, ak goobaleak fugaaschi bea ng'uta ea ghoahiita Giri ak gwanuus Resini. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.16.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.16.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 16:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iidu nea gawa Ahasi Dameski gwaroonyi sea Digilat-Bileseri was sugoocheanda Ashuru. Hean dea heeda wagiida mida Dameski. Hean Ahasi sugoocheanda gweasa Uriya ashoohoocheanda giduurji heeda wagiida ea gideaba eesin dea uurjeata. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.16.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.16.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 16:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean Uriya was ashoohoocheanda, ghwadeas heeda wagiida nea ghwadeasta diida bea Dameskiin, aba gidarukusiinda Ahasi was sugoocheanda. Ak Uriya was ashoohoocheanda ghwalamwach deesta, ghoahiit heeda miigabiikna Ahasi aba Dameski. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.16.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.16.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 16:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iidu nea gabiikna sugoocheanda Dameski nea ghwadaah heedida bea wagiidean. Hean gwaneekiisa sugoocheanda heedida bea wagiidean Hean gwaneekiisa sugoocheanda heedida bea wagiidean, hean gwaneekiisa ak ghoadayda haleanjeeda sisapa geadi bea ghadooweeda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.16.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.16.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 16:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak ghaghwarda haleanjeeda sisabwa geadi bea ghadooweeda sighwarda, nea ghoadayda booga sisabwa geadi bea ghadooweeda ak goohiisa haleanjeeda sisabwa geadi sileeha, nea goohiisa foojeanda was haleanjeeda sisabwa geadi bea hoyyoo heeda wagiida. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.16.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.16.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 16:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea heeda wagiida bea Oormeeda mida madeeda NG'UTAMIIDA, hean ghoang'aamwa madeeda gheeda bea bugusta headaanyi bea wagiida ea gheeda NG'UTAMIIDA, ak gageanu ghwayiin wiilooda ng'eanyiida ghayeawa bea heeda wagiida. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.16.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.16.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 16:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gwarukusa Ahasi Uriya ashoohoocheanda nea gwayeesha, “Ghwarda haleanjeeda sisapa geadi bea ghadooweeda aba heeda wagiida haw was haleanjeeda sisapa geadi sigwariida bea sakteayda. Ea gea sisabwa geadi was dearanga bea shing'ada ea gea sisabwa geadi sighwarda bea sugoocheanda, ea gea sisabwa geadi was dearangaaschi, ea haleanjeeda sisabwa geadi sighwarda bea buuneesean bea badayda ng'eanyiida ea haleanjeeda sisabwa geadi was dearanga nyaawa ea gea sileeha. Ak giihiisi foojeanda sean bea haleanjeeda sisabwa geadi bea ghadooweeda sighwarda, ea foojeanda sean bea lukghumeeda. Nea heeda wagiida bea oormeeda oomu gajea deanyu gil.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.16.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.16.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 16:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uriya was ashoohoocheanda gwasinda haleanjeeda gidarukusiinda Ahasi was sugoocheanda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.16.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.16.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 16:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iidu Ahasi was sugoocheanda ghwalach beehajeega gidaghuuta mida hoorgajeega, ak gageanda gulukuuda mida uhuudaanyi. Nea goorareang'u badooda mida badayda heeyda sisna dahaabu siguura dahaabu mida hing'eadaydaanyi, ak ghwayiin badayda lagheanga sijip. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.16.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.16.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 16:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak ghwayam doodooda sisin bea sabaato sideeksa jeedeaba gheawi, ea gidaghuuta mida jarooda jea gwasku sugoocheanda, hean ghwayam goofuursiinyi sea gheeda NG'UTAMIIDA nea gabaysiina sugoocheanda Ashuru. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.16.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.16.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 16:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asi ng'asheega sean sin Ahasi, heapi miyeeng'oorsa jeeda Gitaabooda Damanyoojiga bea sugoodiga Yuda? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.16.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.16.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 16:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iidu ghami Ahasi ak geebung'sa heeda bung'eadinga ghweanigaaschi aba mujiineeda Dawdi. Ak gawa hoorgeadaanyi bea sugoocheanduumeeda orjeedaanyi was Hesekiya.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.16.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.16.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
